WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,180
The hotel has been booked

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,700
When I was cleaning up my bathroom today,

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,500
500 yuan was found under his bed.

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,170
Our daughter is getting better and better at saving money now.

5
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:11,130
Yu Yu has missed you so much these days

6
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:15,340
Just stay

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,620
You see, your children miss you too

8
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,820
What's more, about Yu Yu

9
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:19,420
We have to sit down and talk

10
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,060
After all, it’s only been a few days

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,580
You don’t want your parents to know tomorrow

12
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:34,390
You secretly gave birth to a granddaughter for them abroad, okay? Good luck tonight, Zheng Xian.

13
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:35,990
How long has it been since you took a shower?

14
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:37,270
Why do you smell something?
